  "content": "<h1><strong>這個模組將在遊戲中添加獨特的槍械組合！</strong></h1><p><strong>執行此模組需要安裝Geckolib，因為它包含動畫！</strong></p><h1><strong>加入我們的Discord伺服器以獲得支援：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"> <a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/BGdWrY8ZvR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></span></strong></h1><h1><strong>查看我個人資料中的GreenboyLegendary槍械模組：</strong></h1><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ElHuUsQZO6E?si=VyC8AaFjkbpmKmQu\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>此模組v3版本影片：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a0MSfNalFHI?si=0LSllVdR6NDSb72f\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p><strong>我製作的Minecraft Steve岩漿動畫，請支持：</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5NIhXzCuLQg?si=vZrMFPJ7JGPuvRGq\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p><strong>此模組第二版影片：</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qxlh_0TtHMo?si=ZPi1YhUnLCxfQAmd\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p><strong>此模組第一版影片：</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wA3K82xRi9w?si=Np8ow81C-Ytee_og\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p><strong>v3版本特色：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>新增槍械</strong></li>\n<li><strong>MG 34（機槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>迷你烏茲（衝鋒槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Tec99（衝鋒槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>修正彈藥模型，現在彈藥可見</strong></li>\n<li><strong>新增創意模式物品欄「槍械」分頁，方便查找槍械</strong></li>\n<li><strong>槍械合成配方位於媒體分頁中</strong></li>\n<li><strong>查看影片以了解此模組的所有內容</strong></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>這是個優質的槍械模組，將為遊戲添加獨特的槍械組合，清單如下！</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>AWM（狙擊槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>啄木鳥（狙擊槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>機槍（連射）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>MP5（衝鋒槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>M4A1（步槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>帕拉法爾（步槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Scar（步槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>手槍（普通）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>手槍、步槍子彈（適用所有手槍、步槍和衝鋒槍）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>狙擊槍彈藥（所有狙擊槍適用）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>機槍彈藥</strong></li>\n<li><strong>靶子（雕像）</strong></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
